// Title: Legitimate Application Writing Files In Uncommon Location
// Rule ID: 1cf465a1-2609-4c15-9b66-c32dbe4bfd67
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218, attack.command-and-control, attack.t1105
// Category: file_event
